          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683866033">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="2034047">Cachin8r</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP759 Champlain Park&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second of 12 today, #859. We approached this one slowly as a car was parked right beside the cap. However it turned out to just be other cachers looking for the same brass cap! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; After a nice chat we took a few hour break before finding the other caches today. This cap was fairly scratched/dinged up, but all others of the day were in great shape. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Cachin&lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_8ball.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;r&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
